            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-17T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-18T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-16T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-17T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. The chance of morning frost in the north. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light before dawn. Overnight temperatures falling to between 2 and 7 with daytime temperatures reaching between 16 and 20.</text>
